+
+**Status: completed and closed. Do not run another physical interval from this
+archive.** Original budget8; executed6; blocked-control slots unavailable2 and
+closed. No training, policy selection, neural forward pass or device was used.
+
+Prescribed Approach traveled.1 and entered peer touch. At loneliness.15 it
+measured−.007499993 versus0 in matched toy/passive controls. At initial0 it stayed0
+while controls drifted+.006. All eleven raw biological changes and costs are
+preserved; no scalar reward or isolated channel credit is invented.
+
+This supplies physical interval evidence, not authenticated neural-origin
+memory. V1's exact-source and successor queries remain Unknown in empty stores.
+The blocked controls failed cold candidate enumeration, not physical movement;
+there is no measured failed-Approach contrast. Read RESULTS.md for both limits.
+
+Files:
+- FROZEN_PLAN.md: original eight-slot source, conditions, budget and paper context.
+- PREFLIGHT_REVISION.md: prospective reduction to six before any physical run.
+- SOURCE_BINDING.json: original and executed source commits, trees and hashes.
+- outcomes.jsonl, summary.json, run-ledger.jsonl: public finite scalar receipts.
+- RESULTS.md: interpretation, all eleven lanes, drift contrasts and limits.
+- PRIOR_INSPECT_PROVENANCE_ERRATUM.md: real biology versus synthetic neural label.
+- QUALIFICATION.json: commands/status and finite log hashes.
+- summarize.py: read-only scalar summarizer; it cannot execute a world.
+
+Default execution is safe: the physical unit test is #[ignore], requires an
+explicit output-directory environment variable and refuses an existing run
+marker. Ordinary Cargo tests can execute only this fixture's cold preflight,
+which advances no biology. No hosted job/workflow was added or invoked. Packaging
+and publication do not opt into the ignored test. Neither a new directory nor a
+manual --ignored invocation is authorized by this completed batch.
+
+Only test/documentation source and scalar output are shared. No learned weights,
+private banks, neural source vectors, optimizer/activation state, sealed source
+JSON or full saved world/creature is included. The new module is cfg(test) only;
+production/default interfaces and acquired state remain unchanged.
+
+Repository log copies remove trailing whitespace and surplus final blank lines.
+The evidence archive also preserves byte-exact original logs, with both hashes
+in QUALIFICATION.json. No test content or numerical result was changed.
