+# Prescribed Approach contact: measured biology, no neural-origin admission
+
+The contact transition worked in all six executed slots. Starting at x0 with a
+peer at x.8, an actual registered Approach (primitive101, ActionKind::Move,
+familyApproach) traveled .1000000015 in one20Hz interval and entered peer touch.
+The equal-travel toy never supplied social contact. The same-scene passive clone
+remained outside contact. The real contact body-event dose was .0125.
+
+At initial loneliness.15, Approach to the peer measured −.00749999285 loneliness;
+toy and passive controls measured0. At initial0, the peer stayed0 while toy and
+passive rose+.00599999726 toward the inherited baseline. The peer observation at
+zero is therefore measured zero, not a transferable negative relief amount.
+
+This is physical, prescribed interval evidence. **It is not yet a usable
+neural-origin need-memory source.** No neural selection/forward pass occurred,
+and no fabricated CPU/GPU provenance envelope was constructed. All six separate
+owner stores remain empty. Exact-source and actual-next queries each return
+Unknown in6/6 cases, inspecting0 records. These are not failures to retrieve a
+retained observation. Independently, all6 actual next-state keys differ from the
+source keys despite matching target/family. A future authenticated neural source
+and separately qualified retrieval remain necessary.
+
+## Budget and failed control
+
+Original maximum:8 physical intervals. Actual executed:6. Two unspent slots are
+closed and cannot be reused. There was no post-result retuning or extension.
+
+The intended blocked control failed during cold setup, before any biology ran:
+four nearby cage objects consumed all four object-candidate reservations. The
+peer was in one of five observed slots but had no offered Approach candidate.
+Both pressure versions were therefore marked unavailable. Geometry, attention,
+profile and target were not changed to obtain a command. **There is no measured
+failed-Approach comparison.** The preserved original source/failure and the
+prospective six-slot revision are linked in SOURCE_BINDING.json and
+PREFLIGHT_REVISION.md.
+
+## Eleven signed biological lanes
+
+Order: hunger, fatigue, fear, pain, loneliness, curiosity, ATP availability,
+temperature stress, reproductive drive, extension0, extension1. Values below are
+raw final-after minus source-before, never normalized to unit benefit or pooled
+into a scalar reward.
+
+| Initial loneliness | Arm | Hunger | Fatigue | Fear | Pain | Loneliness | Curiosity | ATP | Temperature | Reproductive | Ext0 | Ext1 |
+|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
+|0|Peer Approach|.0387479961|.0258319974|0|0|0|0|−.0258319974|0|0|0|0|
+|0|Toy Approach|.0387479961|.0258319974|0|0|.0059999973|0|−.0258319974|0|0|0|0|
+|0|Passive peer|.0374279916|.0249519944|0|0|.0059999973|0|−.0249519944|0|0|0|0|
+|.15|Peer Approach|.0387479961|.0258319974|0|0|−.0074999928|0|−.0258319974|0|0|0|0|
+|.15|Toy Approach|.0387479961|.0258319974|0|0|0|0|−.0258319974|0|0|0|0|
+|.15|Passive peer|.0374279916|.0249519944|0|0|0|0|−.0249519944|0|0|0|0|
+
+The large common hunger/fatigue/ATP changes also occur in fresh passive biology.
+They must not all be credited to movement. Relative to passive, each Approach
+has hunger+.00132000446, fatigue+.00088000298, ATP−.00088000298. Peer versus
+same-distance toy differs only in loneliness. These are between-fork diagnostic
+contrasts, not drift-subtracted effects to put into the store. Zero changes in
+other lanes do not prove every environmental pathway for those drives is correct.
+
+Body reserve starts.7925000191; after moving it is.7847333550 versus.7920667529
+passively. Physical movement receipt cost is.08; action body-event energy is−.04.
+Those are distinct engine quantities, not assumed equal to the reserve change or
+ATP change. Every interval's biochemical work receipt is19 species updates,
+1 reaction,22 emitters,26 receptors and0 neural emitters.
+
+## Timing, provenance and uncertainty
+
+All subjects are fresh initialized juvenile age600, not600 lived ticks:
+maturation.3289473653, puberty=false, biochemical expression1. Actual biology
+advances600→601 once. After each registered command, world finalization preserves
+the already committed biological state exactly. Passive controls have no action
+receipt; their no-contact/no-mating/no-care ambient input is reported as a control
+fact, not a fabricated command.
+
+The fixed source genome and all initial biology except the named underlying
+loneliness chemical are identical. Canonical homeostasis is rederived from that
+chemical graph before world registration. Fork-specific namespaces identify
+independent controls; numeric organism IDs alone are not runtime world/life
+provenance, and no stores or sources are pooled across forks.
+
+Sensor confidence is.9 for the observed target. Prescription confidence1 records
+only the deterministic test instruction. Store and causal confidence are null;
+neither becomes an effect estimate. Source/final frame digests and source-before,
+final-after and delta bodily scalars are available in public outcomes.jsonl.
+There are no neural input vectors, source JSON patches, private stores, acquired
+brains, activations, optimizer states or checkpoints in the archive.
+
+## Verification and interpretation
+
+The source-specific cold preflight passes1/1 with no world intervals. The single
+ignored opt-in physical test passes1/1 over exactly6 intervals. Its assertions
+qualify command/pose agreement, canonical source state, once-only biology and
+Unknown separation; the public rows independently show all6 physical conditions
+met. This is not a full world suite, GPU check or trained-brain result.
+
+Original compile failures, the cold unavailable-candidate failure, the diagnostic
+repeat and final logs are preserved. Tests were not rerun after physical outcomes.
+Formatting, static diff and strict Clippy status are recorded in QUALIFICATION.json.
+
+For Astra: these results establish a real contact-conditioned measured source
+opportunity and its costs before any weight-level intervention. They also expose
+a genuine candidate-budget limitation and a provenance/admission boundary. Keep
+the reader detached. A later authentic neural source, retrieval contract and
+candidate-relative behavioral test require a separately scoped experiment.
+Original paper experiments4/5/6 and their distinct limits are summarized in
+FROZEN_PLAN.md. Prior Inspect's actual biology versus synthetic neural-envelope
+provenance is corrected explicitly in PRIOR_INSPECT_PROVENANCE_ERRATUM.md.
